  "claim": "The star of the live-action scripted television series produced by Warner Horizon Television, also co-created, starred in, produced, and directed the cult web-series Poor Paul.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Kevin Schmidt. Sentence: Kevin Gerard Schmidt (born August 16, 1988) is an American actor, known best for his role as Henry in \"Cheaper by the Dozen\" and its sequel and as Noah Newman in \"The Young and the Restless\".\nPage: Kevin Schmidt. Sentence: Schmidt also starred on Cartoon Network's first live-action scripted television series, \"Unnatural History\".\nPage: Kevin Schmidt. Sentence: Schmidt also co-created, starred in, produced, and directed a cult web-series, \"Poor Paul\".\nPage: Unnatural History (TV series). Sentence: Unnatural History is a Canadian-American television series produced by Warner Horizon Television for Cartoon Network and YTV.",
