        "original_id": "c9c905f6-758d-5994-a1cf-aa942a1399f9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Schmidt\n- Products: Cheaper by the Dozen, Cheaper by the Dozen 2, The Young and the Restless, Unnatural History, Poor Paul\n- Companies: Cartoon Network, Warner Horizon Television, YTV\n- Topics: acting roles, television production\n\nFacts:\n- Kevin Schmidt was born on August 16, 1988, and he is an American actor.\n- Kevin Schmidt is best known for playing Henry in \"Cheaper by the Dozen\" and its sequel \"Cheaper by the Dozen 2.\"\n- Kevin Schmidt is also known for playing Noah Newman in \"The Young and the Restless.\"\n- Kevin Schmidt starred in \"Unnatural History,\" which was Cartoon Network's first live-action scripted television series.\n- \"Unnatural History\" is a Canadian-American television series produced by Warner Horizon Television for Cartoon Network and YTV.\n- Kevin Schmidt co-created, starred in, produced, and directed the cult web series \"Poor Paul.\"",
